# Implementation Plan - Sidebar History Feature

Add a search history feature to the sidebar that stores and displays recent search queries in a "latest to older" order (LIFO stack behavior).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - History will be stored in `localStorage` to persist across sessions.
> - Clicking a history item will navigate the user to the Semantic Search page and automatically re-run that search.
> - We will limit the history to the last 10-15 items to keep the sidebar clean.

## Proposed Changes

