#### [NEW] [historySlice.js](file:///c:/Users/KIIT0001/Desktop/Smart-search/Frontend/src/features/history/historySlice.js)
- Define `history` state as an array.
- Action `addToHistory(query)`: Adds a new query to the beginning of the array. If the query already exists, move it to the front.
- Action `clearHistory()`: Resets the history array.
- Logic to load from and save to `localStorage`.

